<details id="publishing-profile-panel"><summary>Reuse a publishing setup</summary>
<p class="small">Keep your destination, title-handling choices, and personal review routine for the next article. Download a profile file, then load it on your next visit. No account or autosave. Applying it changes export choices and clears approval; your article and source notes stay in place.</p>
<fieldset id="publishing-profile-controls" disabled><legend class="sr-only">Reusable publishing profile</legend>
<label for="publishing-profile-name">Profile name, required to save a profile</label><input id="publishing-profile-name" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" placeholder="For example, my weekly website post">
<p class="small">The file uses the current destination and title options below. For page Markdown, it also keeps the title-heading choice in More export options.</p>
<label for="publishing-profile-checks">Personal publishing checklist, optional</label><textarea id="publishing-profile-checks" rows="4" maxlength="1287" aria-describedby="publishing-profile-checks-help publishing-profile-error" placeholder="Compare names and dates with my sources&#10;Add images in my website editor&#10;Preview the final page before publishing"></textarea><p id="publishing-profile-checks-help" class="small">One reminder per line, up to eight of 160 characters each. Editing reminders clears their ticks and export approval. These reminders do not block exporting.</p><p id="publishing-profile-error" class="field-error small" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<button id="download-publishing-profile" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Download publishing profile</button>
<p class="small">This unencrypted JSON file includes only the profile name, export choices, and reminder text. It excludes article fields, source notes, private review questions, completed ticks, and approval. Keep reminder text free of private details if sharing. A workspace backup does not save this setup.</p>
<label for="load-publishing-profile">Load a publishing profile to preview</label><input id="load-publishing-profile" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" aria-describedby="publishing-profile-file-help"><p id="publishing-profile-file-help" class="small">A Draft to Page profile JSON file, up to 16 KiB. Read locally. Nothing applies until you choose Apply profile.</p>
<section id="publishing-profile-preview" hidden aria-labelledby="publishing-profile-preview-heading"><h5 id="publishing-profile-preview-heading">Profile to apply</h5><p id="publishing-profile-preview-name"></p><ul id="publishing-profile-preview-choices"></ul><ol id="publishing-profile-preview-checks"></ol><div class="actions"><button id="apply-publishing-profile" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Apply profile</button><button id="cancel-publishing-profile" type="button" class="secondary">Cancel preview</button></div></section>
<button id="clear-publishing-profile" type="button" class="secondary">Remove profile name and checklist</button>
</fieldset><p id="publishing-profile-status" class="small" role="status" aria-live="polite">Publishing profiles are loading. Writing and exports remain available.</p></details>
